<p>Use your stored vim to supercharge your body, recovering <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">28, 38, 46, 52, 58</acronym> stamina and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">120, 162, 195, 222, 247</acronym> life.</p><p>Additionally, you will be able to survive your HP going under 0, down to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">-153, -206, -247, -282, -312</acronym> HP, for the next 8 turns.</p><p>These values will increase with your Spellpower.</p><p>Spell criticals with this talent also effect the stamina gain.</p>